{
  "_about": "Every path the v9 build (www/) writes for the production base `/`, emitted by www/scripts/postbuild.mjs on every build and drift-checked by scripts/check_www_build.py. deploy/sync_site_to_s3.sh and deploy/rollback_site.sh exclude exactly these through deploy/www_owned_paths.py — one owner per path (#5534). `live_at_root` is the cut-over switch, not build output: false = the build is served at /next/v9/ only; true = the build owns `/` and every `www/**` merge deploys there. `room_public` is the Coaching Room's committed publication switch, not build output: \"off\" = no room page is built; \"cr1\" = every build publishes CR1 (/system/calibration/, /system/ledger/refuted/, the /system/ entry); \"cr2\" = CR1 + CR2 (/system/coaches/<id>/record/ and the entry on each coach page); never CR3.",
